<body>
  <header>
    <div class="navwrap">
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="about.html">Meet</a>
        <a href="specialties.html" class="primary">Offerings</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="panel reveal" aria-labelledby="offers-heading">
      <h1 id="offers-heading">Therapeutic offerings — named for clarity</h1>
      <p class="muted">Short, steady options shaped to the work you want to do. I describe these to make choices simple; we’ll adapt each plan to you.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:18px">
      <div>
        <section class="panel reveal">
          <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">Wayfinding Sessions</h2>
          <p class="muted">Focused short-term plan for a specific decision, transition, or problem that needs practical sorting. Often 6–8 sessions with measurable tasks between meetings.</p>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="service">
              <strong>Who it suits</strong>
              <p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0">People wanting faster clarity — work, relationships, role changes.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service">
              <strong>How we work</strong>
              <p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0">We map the issue, generate options, and practice small behavioral experiments that fit your life.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel reveal" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">Root & Routine</h2>
          <p class="muted">A weekly rhythm to focus on longer-term patterns: mood, relationships, or recurring struggles. Designed to hold steady work over months.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="service"><strong>Structure</strong><p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0">Ongoing weekly sessions with periodic check-ins on goals and skill practice.</p></div>
            <div class="service"><strong>Measure</strong><p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0">Progress is judged by functional changes and your experience, not promises of cure.</p></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel reveal" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">Beacon Session (Single consult)</h2>
          <p class="muted">A single 50-minute meeting useful for quick perspective, a planning session, or deciding next steps. Not a crisis appointment.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="panel reveal">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px">Investment & access</h3>
        <p class="muted">Framing sessions as intentional investments: clear, transparent, and flexible.</p>

        <div class="pricing" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="price-card">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <div>
                <div style="font-weight:700">Beacon Session</div>
                <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">One 50-minute consult</div>
              </div>
              <div style="font-weight:700">${{BEACON_PRICE}}</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="price-card">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <div>
                <div style="font-weight:700">Wayfinding</div>
                <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">6–8 session plan</div>
              </div>
              <div style="font-weight:700">${{WAYFINDING_PACKAGE}}</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="price-card">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <div>
                <div style="font-weight:700">Root & Routine</div>
                <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Weekly sessions (ongoing)</div>
              </div>
              <div style="font-weight:700">${{WEEKLY_SESSION}}</div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:14px">
          <a href="book.html" class="cta">Reserve a time</a>
        </div>

        <hr style="margin:14px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(15,23,32,0.04)">
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Insurance: I do not bill insurance directly. I can provide a superbill for possible reimbursement depending on your plan.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="panel reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">Notes on care</h3>
      <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 8px">Therapy is collaborative. We name goals together and regularly check whether the chosen plan fits the life you have. If needs fall outside my scope, I will help identify appropriate referrals.</p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion
    (function(){
      var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var items = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(reduce){ items.forEach(function(i){ i.classList.add('visible'); }); return; }
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){ entries.forEach(function(en){ if(en.isIntersecting){ en.target.classList.add('visible'); io.unobserve(en.target); } }); }, {threshold:0.08});
      items.forEach(function(it){ io.observe(it); });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Method — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fffaf6;--ink:#0b1220;--muted:#51606a;--accent:#c06a6a;--card:#fff}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
    header{position:sticky;top:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,18,32,0.04)}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .lead{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fffaf0,#fff);padding:22px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(10,14,20,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px}
    .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:18px}
    .step{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,18,32,0.04)}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}

    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 480ms ease,transform 480ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1)}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}

    .try-inline{display:inline-block;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="about.html">Who I am</a>
